      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIDEN TIME (1) was disappointing here two back over 1200m when, according to the rider, he resented the kickback. He then stepped out in journey and was sent forward and gave a huge sight before being grabbed right on the line. Comes back in trip this time but suspect he'll go forward again for the clear air and will take beating. PERCUSSION PRINCE (2) is a former WA galloper having first try here. Racing well and best figures stack up. Looks a leading chance. PRESS EXPRESS (5) is overdue for a win but could be ready to break through following back-to-back seconds. SAXON BEACH (7) wasn't beaten far last time and must be included.",
